  "CardDescription": {
    "DefaultText": "A good cover crop deal for letting fields rest because of its soil structure improving capabilities.",
    "Text": "良好的覆土作物，能够改善土质，适宜用作土壤休耕。",
    "zh": "良好的覆土作物，能够改善土质，适宜用作土壤休耕。",
    "en": "A good cover crop deal for letting fields rest because of its soil structure improving capabilities.",
    "ja": "土壌構造の改良効果がある被覆作物。"
  },
  "CanBeRenamed": false,
  "AlternateNames": [],
  "LiquidSuffixName": {
    "DefaultText": "",
    "Text": "",
    "zh": "",
    "en": "",
    "ja": ""
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "DefaultText": "<b>Found:</b> Pine Clearings. \n\n<b>Growth Needs:</b> Mid or High Acidity, Any Hydration and Mid or High Structure. Produces the most yield on High Nutrients during Spring and Summer. \n\n<b>Benefits:</b> Bedding. Roofing. Cover Crop. ",
    "Text": "<b>产地：</b>松木区域。\\n\\n<b>需求：</b>中或高等酸度、任意湿度、中或高等土质。春、夏季高养分下产量最高。\\n\\n<b>效果：</b>垫料，房顶材料，覆土作物。",
    "zh": "<b>产地：</b>松木区域。\\n\\n<b>需求：</b>中或高等酸度、任意湿度、中或高等土质。春、夏季高养分下产量最高。\\n\\n<b>效果：</b>垫料，房顶材料，覆土作物。",
    "en": "<b>Found:</b> Pine Clearings. \\n\\n<b>Growth Needs:</b> Mid or High Acidity, Any Hydration and Mid or High Structure. Produces the most yield on High Nutrients during Spring and Summer. \\n\\n<b>Benefits:</b> Bedding. Roofing. Cover Crop. ",
    "ja": " <b>入手：</b>松の空き地。\\n\\n<b>生育条件：</b>酸性度（中～高）、水分量（任意）、土壌構造（中～高）。春から夏にかけて、高栄養土壌で最も収穫量が増える。\\n\\n<b>用途：</b>寝床材。屋根材。被覆作物。"
  },
